## Use of this site

The content on this site — reviews, tutorials, troubleshooting guides, and app information pages — is provided for general informational purposes. We make a good-faith effort to keep it accurate and up to date, but we don't guarantee that every detail (such as an app's current version or specifications) is current, since third-party apps change outside our control.

## No official affiliation

Unless an article explicitly says otherwise, this site is not affiliated with, endorsed by, or sponsored by the developers of the apps we write about. App names and logos belong to their respective owners.

## External links

We link to official app stores and developer websites. We aren't responsible for the content, policies, or practices of those external sites.

## Advertising

This site may display advertising served by third parties, including Google. See our [Privacy Policy](/privacy) for how that affects data collection.

## Changes to these terms

We may update these terms as the site evolves. Continued use of the site after a change means you accept the updated terms.

## Contact

Questions about these terms can be sent via the [Contact page](/contact).
